VALUES
  ('45246b83-5334-53b6-8436-17b94b90f2ad', (SELECT question_id FROM questions WHERE external_id = '14141_dovesound_review'), 'A', 'Yes, because Lydia Sound Systems did not meet its burden to defeat Mary’s motion for summary judgment on the issue of actual malice.', 1, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'A is correct. This is a summary-judgment burden question. Mary supported her motion with her own affidavit denying the state of mind required for actual malice. Lydia Sound Systems had the trial burden on actual malice and offered no contrary evidence. On this record, Lydia Sound Systems has not created a genuine dispute on the element the court identified as necessary.
